{
  "file_id": "3605",
  "text_count": 61,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "Look, T.K! Ogremon's over\nthere.",
      "_offset": 581,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "What's he doing here?",
      "_offset": 617,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "(Gh! Why are the brats here?! I'll\nhave to put on a little act!)",
      "_offset": 639,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "He's not coming to attack us like\nhe usually does...",
      "_offset": 704,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Think he's planning something?",
      "_offset": 757,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "Ahem! Hey, whatcha doin' here at\nthe arena?",
      "_offset": 788,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "You're the Ogremon who's attacked\nus before, aren't you?",
      "_offset": 832,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "No, that'd be my cousin's\ngreat-grandfather's little brother\nOgremon.",
      "_offset": 889,
      "_length": 69,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "I'm a different Ogremon!",
      "_offset": 959,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "I'm a different Ogremon!",
      "_offset": 984,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "I'm a different Ogremon!",
      "_offset": 1009,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Well, we'll leave it at that.",
      "_offset": 1038,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "What are you doing here, Ogremon?",
      "_offset": 1068,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "My favorite bone club's gotten all\nbanged up, so I'm here to get a\nnew one.",
      "_offset": 1102,
      "_length": 75,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "What kind of bone do you need?",
      "_offset": 1178,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "How couldja not know? Believe it\nor not, it's a SkullGreymon bone!",
      "_offset": 1209,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "A SkullGreymon bone?!",
      "_offset": 1276,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "Oh hey! Yeah...you guys, why\ndon'tcha help me out?",
      "_offset": 1298,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "I'm goin' to the back of the\nunderground ruins. Follow me!",
      "_offset": 1349,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "We'll have to help Ogremon, we\ncan't back out of it like this...",
      "_offset": 1408,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "Hey, guys... is it okay to trust\nthat Ogremon?",
      "_offset": 1473,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "We'll beat him up!",
      "_offset": 1520,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Doesn't feel like a trap.",
      "_offset": 1539,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "Once we get a chance, I'll have\nGarurumon take him out.",
      "_offset": 1565,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "That's not what I meant, I mean\nwhether he's trying to lead us\ninto a trap!",
      "_offset": 1621,
      "_length": 75,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Aren't you thinking too far into\nthis?",
      "_offset": 1697,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "Ugh, I don't care anymore!",
      "_offset": 1736,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "Doesn't feel like he's leading us\ninto a trap.",
      "_offset": 1763,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "After all, we're the ones who\ncaught him off guard.",
      "_offset": 1810,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "What if we're being naive? What if\nhe ends up holding me hostage!",
      "_offset": 1862,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "Then I'll come save you.",
      "_offset": 1928,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "If you're willing to do that, then\nI'll forgive you!",
      "_offset": 1953,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "You're finally here! Let's start\nhuntin' for that bone.",
      "_offset": 2006,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "So now we're bone hunters?",
      "_offset": 2062,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "Shut up! What I'm sayin' is, we\nneed to hunt down a SkullGreymon\nbone!",
      "_offset": 2089,
      "_length": 70,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "SkullGreymon's hard to deal with,\nso do exactly as I say!",
      "_offset": 2160,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "That's a huge door...",
      "_offset": 2218,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "I wonder what's behind it?",
      "_offset": 2240,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "Wanna take a look?",
      "_offset": 2267,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "_offset": 2286,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "Hey, little helper! Whatcha doin'?",
      "_offset": 2292,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "Aaaaaaaaaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 2327,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "It's SkullGreymon!",
      "_offset": 2343,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "T.K!",
      "_offset": 2362,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Stop! A SkullGreymon that's just\nbeen revived is unstoppable!",
      "_offset": 2370,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "T.K's my little brother! I\ncan't just abandon him and run\naway!",
      "_offset": 2432,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "Tch! Fine, then!",
      "_offset": 2499,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "Matt!",
      "_offset": 2516,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "T.K, you're okay!",
      "_offset": 2524,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "_offset": 2545,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "Good thing Patamon's fine, too.",
      "_offset": 2551,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "Ah, that was a shock...",
      "_offset": 2583,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "Ogremon, did you find a bone you\ncould use?",
      "_offset": 2607,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "Yeah! I've finally nabbed a good\nbone! Matt!",
      "_offset": 2651,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "What do you want, Ogremon!",
      "_offset": 2698,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "I've fought a lot of battles, but\nto stand up against the fearsome\nSkullGreymon!",
      "_offset": 2725,
      "_length": 80,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "You're pretty okay guys! You've\ngot guts! I'll give you this!\nThanks for helping with the hunt!",
      "_offset": 2806,
      "_length": 95,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "Hey, wait a minute...",
      "_offset": 2902,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "Should we take it?",
      "_offset": 2924,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "Thanks, Matt!",
      "_offset": 2943,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "Of course! You're my brother,\nafter all.",
      "_offset": 2959,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    }
  ]
}